      "quote": "Net interest margin decreased by 3 basis points on the prior year, reflecting: Lower deposit margins due to reduced earnings on transaction and savings balances reflecting decreases in the cash rate (down 6 basis points); Unfavourable portfolio mix (down 3 basis points) due to a reduction in higher margin consumer finance balances, more than offsetting the mix benefit from customers switching to at-call deposits from investment deposits; Lower earnings on equity due to the falling interest rate environment (down 3 basis points); and Lower consumer finance margins due to a reduction in the prop",
